        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oryatwara endiijo mpaya, Arooni n'abatabani bate engaro zaabo aha mutwe gwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima ogiite, otware aha shagama yaayo, ogisiigye aha nshonga y'okutu kwa buryo kwa Arooni n'aha nshonga z'amatu ga buryo ag'abatabani, n'aha bikumu bishaija eby'engaro zaabo eza buryo, n'aha bikumu bishaija eby'ebigyere byabo ebya buryo; eshagama eraatsigareho ogishukyere embaju zoona ez'eitambiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.8.26+LEV.8.27+LEV.8.28+LEV.8.29+LEV.8.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 8:26-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 9:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi otware aha shagama ey'aha itambiro n'aha majuta ag'okushukaho ahabw'okushoroora, obimiisiire Arooni n'ebijwaro bye, n'abatabani n'ebijwaro byabo, abe oyeziibwe n'ebijwaro bye, n'abatabani n'ebijwaro byabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
