                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi barye ebyo bintu ebihongirwe ahabw'okubashoroora n'okubeeza; kwonka otari munyamurwa ataribiryaho, ahakuba n'ebirikwera. ",
          "type": "text",
