            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oryamara ebiro mushanju noohongyerera eitambiro, nooryeza; ribe eririkwera munonga; kyona ekirikora ahari eryo itambiro kiryaba ekirikwera.",
          "type": "text",
